            <p class="text-secondary">Sector tradicional reconocido por sus cocinerías, mariscos, pescados y artesanía local.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="meta-pill">2 a 3 horas</span>
              <span class="meta-pill">Medio</span>
              <span class="meta-pill">Media</span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
              <small class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light">Mariscos</small>
              <small class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light">Artesanía</small>
              <small class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light">Mercado</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <article class="place-card">
